  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOAL - Green Oriented Associations for Levelling Up Digital Mentorship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This call focuses on strengthening participatory democracy by engaging civil society actors in the dialogue on the core policy objectives of the European Green Deal. The European Green Deal is the new growth strategy of the EU adopted in 2019, which has the ultimate aim of transforming the EU into a carbon-neutral and resource-efficient economy by 2050.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The project proposal has two specific objectives: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhanced operational and institutional capacity of TIM to enable its exporting members to comply with EU Green Deal Regulations by facilitating their adjustments through Digital Mentorship Software, thereby enhancing their operational and corporate capacities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To promote the green and digital transformation of exporting companies in Turkey by strengthening the role of Turkish Exporters Assembly (T&#xbf;M) in the decision-making process by conducting lobbying efforts in influential public institutions and organizations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project was awarded under the call for proposal that aims to support the improvement of the capacities of civil society organisations towards the achievement of the ambitious targets of the European Green Deal.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
